---
manual: art.fill.image_path
lines: [1688, 1696]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: M18
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  fill "assets/red-40x30.png"
  star 200, 200, 5
end
----------- test code
# The manual's example with our solid #ff0000 test image in place of static/avatar.png.
# A string that is not a colour is an image path (M18), and red can only come from it.
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(200, 200).first(3), "the star is painted with the image"
assert_equal [255, 255, 255], pixel_at(200, 320).first(3), "and nothing outside the star is"
